    "规则": {
      "status": "CATALOG_REPORTED_UNVERIFIED",
      "value": "本条只写 Jay Kaeppel《The Agony and Ecstasy of Trend-Following》(2019-07-19)：月末计算 **SPY**（或SPX）**月线 MACD(12,26,9)**；若当月收盘 MACD **>0** → 次月满仓 **SPY**；若 MACD **≤0** → 次月满仓 **IEI**（Barclays Intermediate Treasury 代理）。不是日线MACD；不是禁拆LBR/OneMinuteMonth。计入美股/ETF。提出日期 2019-07-19。"
    },
